  "considerations_page": 63,
  "conditions": "21 to 25 C (23 C +/-2 C), humidity below 80 %, 1 hour warm-up",
  "note": "Limits are the manufacturer verification limits as printed (Q = quick verification). The manual notes that if no adjustment is made the limits must be guard-banded to no more than 80 % of the Chapter 1 specifications; that guard band is not applied here. Equipment: the manual lists a Keysight 3458A DMM for the AC amplitude and low-frequency flatness tests; this procedure uses a Fluke 5790B. Power meter E4418B with 8482A sensor and 8491A Opt 020 attenuator; frequency counter 53131A Opt 010."
 },
